d. Issue #1017 is the separate ready follow-up for the 67 Serbian member crosswalk. The second, 739.7 m² Maribor source feature is explicitly outside #1018 scope and handed off without assignment. Reproducers are deterministic across two runs; evidence receipt validates as limited, with factual review still required. Reserved branch is rebased to fresh current main da9b0c46; no shared geography, IDs, release pins or production data changed. Any PR will use exactly Closes #1018 only for this bounded assessment; regional/source correctness stays unapproved.","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChengshuLi/WorldAtlas/issues/comments/6004048167/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChengshuLi/WorldAtlas/issues/comments/6004188510","html_url":"https://github.com/ChengshuLi/WorldAtlas/issues/1018#issuecomment-6004188510","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChengshuLi/WorldAtlas/issues/1018","id":6004188510,"node_id":"IC_kwDOU2GYiM8AAAABZeClXg","user":{"login":"ChengshuLi","id":6732996,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MzI5OTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6732996?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi","html_url":"https://github.com/ChengshuLi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChengshuLi/events{/privacy}","received_ev